Read `AGENTS.md` first and treat it as the source of truth.

Use chapter specs as implementation requirements, keep guidance specific, avoid full chapter solutions by default, and use `.tbh/` state when available. Use `tbhbooks-agent-kit` as the canonical shared workflow reference if `.tbh/tbhbooks-agent-kit/` is installed.
